ck with the helper header, the documented nine top-level fields, complete root-ID keys, and all source paragraph IDs. The checker again returned the generic exact-key error before elaboration. Earlier reduced controls with the same top-level shape progressed to root-coverage and Lean-parser diagnostics, so the issue appears tied to some nested contract condition in the latest candidate, not a mathematical implication. I cannot honestly submit this as accepted; continue with the same-stage artifact rather than upgrading the rejection to success.\\\",\\\"basis\\\":\\\"Latest check_draft rejection and earlier reduced check_draft outputs in this stage; source-map paragraphs and root IDs; actual Lean/API probes.\\\",\\\"partial_progress\\\":\\\"H004 typing pattern was elaborated successfully; exact source tensor action was recognized as requiring a commutor transport. The helper header currently specifies commutor-based conversion and explicit tensor-product integer instances, but its surrounding artifact has not passed its structural gate or Lean type gate. No mathematical gap established.\\\"}\"}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[{"type":"function","name":"search_mathlib","description":"在固定 mathlib 的 Lean 源码中搜索正则表达式，返回至多 100 行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_mathlib","description":"读取固定 mathlib 中一个 Mathlib/...lean 文件的指定行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start_line":{"type":"integer"},"line_count":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start_line","line_count"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_task_input","description":"Read an explicitly frozen task document by ID; no other local files are accessible.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"